 "serviceDescription": "Co-op boundaries were digitized by Brian Keller (EDAC) based on <a href='https://www.nmelectric.coop/coops' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>this map<\/a>.<div><br /><\/div><div>Via email from Natalie on 2/7/2024: <\/div><div>Based on Taxali's research of websites (such as https://www.doit.nm.gov/programs/broadband/participating-internet-service-providers/), and then confirmation in text with Alex Trujillo on 2/7/2024, each co-op falls into one of the following service categories:<\/div><div><br /><\/div><div><p style='color:rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px;'><b>Electric cooperatives that are ISPs:<\/b><\/p><p style='color:rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px;'>\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2022\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002Continental Divide Electric Cooperative (Red Bolt)<\/p><p style='color:rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px;'>\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2022\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002Kit Carson<\/p><p style='color:rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px;'>\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2022\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002Sierra Electric (in partnership with Ethos)<\/p><p style='color:rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px;'> <\/p><p style='color:rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px;'><b>Electric cooperatives funded by OBAE to initiate broadband<\/b><\/p><p style='color:rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px;'>\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2022\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002Socorro Electric Cooperative (funded)<\/p><p style='color:rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px;'>\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2022\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002Central New Mexico Electric Cooperative (funded)<\/p><p style='color:rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px;'>\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2022\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002Jemez Mountain Electric Cooperative (funded)<\/p><p style='color:rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px;'> <\/p><p style='color:rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;, &quo